{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Desperate, you took the job. No interview. No questions. Just midnight shifts at a grocery store, alone. Stock the shelves. Sweep the floors. Collect your pay. But you soon realize you aren\u2019t alone, and you were hired for a darker purpose.</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917740/extras/0bd8e75db43f7d8a340615cb68f21abe.avif?t=1769206085\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917740/extras_big/0bd8e75db43f7d8a340615cb68f21abe.webp?t=1769206085 width=1600 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Clock in and get to work. Stock the shelves, mop the floors, clean up the store. Tasks feel routine at first but with every shift, the list grows stranger and more demanding. Do your job. Do not wander. DO NOT STOP.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917740/extras/d850f6db5bff26232da0ee07ceb4e23e.poster.avif?t=1769206085\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917740/extras/d850f6db5bff26232da0ee07ceb4e23e.webm?t=1769206085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917740/extras/d850f6db5bff26232da0ee07ceb4e23e.mp4?t=1769206085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917740/extras/f416bf3da9eb75eaf3ebbf724c3d9995.avif?t=1769206085\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917740/extras_big/f416bf3da9eb75eaf3ebbf724c3d9995.webp?t=1769206085 width=1600 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The store should be empty. But the longer you work, the more the aisles feel alive: breathing, watching, waiting. Hallucinations, whispers, and shadowy figures blur the line between reality and madness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917740/extras/030b9d702e5912ea0f979e473d3daf55.poster.avif?t=1769206085\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917740/extras/030b9d702e5912ea0f979e473d3daf55.webm?t=1769206085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917740/extras/030b9d702e5912ea0f979e473d3daf55.mp4?t=1769206085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917740/extras/0564a321c69d0dc1a4f6173cc0525554.avif?t=1769206085\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917740/extras_big/0564a321c69d0dc1a4f6173cc0525554.webp?t=1769206085 width=1600 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Investigate the store's sinister past: search lockers, breakrooms, and offices for notes, files, and voicemails left by employees who came before you. Uncover something ancient, dark, and sinister, tightening its grip from the shadows. Discover the truth. But it doesn\u2019t set you free, it decides your fate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917740/extras/139602dfe003a88b324b4019b0b3b3e1.poster.avif?t=1769206085\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917740/extras/139602dfe003a88b324b4019b0b3b3e1.webm?t=1769206085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917740/extras/139602dfe003a88b324b4019b0b3b3e1.mp4?t=1769206085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take on the role of a new overnight stocker at a grocery store</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clock in and complete tasks: stocking shelves, mopping floors, cleaning spills, and more.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive 7 shifts: each night introduces new tasks, new areas to explore, and new terrors waiting in the aisles.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate the store's sinister past: search lockers, breakrooms, and offices for notes, files, and voicemails left by employees who came before you.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience escalating horror: hallucinations, whispers, and shadowy figures blur the line between reality and madness.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings: uncover the founder\u2019s legacy and choose whether to resist or submit.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What to Expect</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>~3 hours of story-driven psychological horror.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A mix of simulation and narrative-driven exploration.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive sound design and realistic visuals.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A final choice that decides your fate and the fate of the town.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3917740?t=1769206085","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917740/b39ae9bb4d4959adcb60b6a07c9f36d98a1d25af/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769206085","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917740/c3ad31eb61012bfe16288f22f783fa68d7640c40/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769206085","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917740/c3ad31eb61012bfe16288f22f783fa68d7640c40/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769206085","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Desperate, you took the job. No interview. No questions. Just midnight shifts at a grocery store, alone. Stock the shelves. Sweep the floors. Collect your pay. But you soon realize you aren\u2019t alone, and you were hired for a darker purpose.</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917740/extras